Embark on a linguistic adventure like never before with LinGo Play, the cutting-edge, dynamic, and captivating language learning app that makes mastering a new language a delightful, seamless, and highly effective experience! 

Dive into an extensive range of foreign language learning topics such as Education, Business, Culture, People, Travel, Nature, Animals, Science, Technology, Sports, Tourism, Art, Literature, Music, Food, Appliances, Furniture, Fashion, Beauty, Health, Medicine, and so much more.

70 languages: Arabic, English, Chinese, Czech, Danish, Dutch, English, Finnish, French, German, Greek, Hebrew, Hindi, Hungarian, Indonesian, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese, Romanian, Russian, Slovak, Spanish, Swedish, Thai, Turkish, Vietnamese, Bulgarian, Malay, Ukrainian, Filipino, Afrikaans, Albanian, Amharic, Armenian, Azerbaijani, Belarusian, Bengal, Bosnian, Burmese, Croatian, Dari, Estonian, Georgian, Kazakh, Kurdish, Lao, Latvian, Lithuanian, Macedonian, Malagasy, Mongolian, Nepali, Pashto, Persian, Sinhala, Slovenian, Somali, Swahili, Tamil, Tigrinya, Urdu, Catalan, Serbian etc.

Discover new languages with LinGo's extensive features:
• 5172 flashcards, 4141 words, 373 phrases for comprehensive learning;
• Over 600 English lessons for all levels;
• 16 engaging and interactive exercises;
• Beginner-friendly English courses;
• Advanced materials for linguists and native speakers;
• Evaluative tests and grading system;
• Solo player mode for self-paced learning;
• Online multiplayer for collaborative and competitive learning;
• Exciting tournaments to showcase your skills;
• Certificate to validate your language proficiency

With LinGo Play, transforming your language skills is a cinch, requiring only 10-15 minutes of daily practice to attain fluency, sharpen language intuition, and hone your listening, speaking, reading, and writing abilities. Our app empowers you to expand your vocabulary, build confidence, and maintain your proficiency in the long run, whether you're at home, traveling, or squeezing in practice during a busy day.

One of LinGo Play's standout features is its focus on practical, real-world vocabulary and authentic language usage, which ensures that you can apply what you've learned to everyday situations. With our app, you'll gain the ability to communicate more effectively, confidently, and naturally in a foreign language, whether you're traveling, working, networking, or simply conversing with friends and acquaintances from diverse linguistic backgrounds.

LinGo Play also lets you play online in duo mode with friends or other players, fostering collaboration, friendly competition, and motivation in your language learning journey. Our app offers a variety of exercises, tests, and challenges, as well as an exciting online tournament feature, allowing you to test your newfound language skills against players worldwide, while also expanding your cultural horizons and developing valuable intercultural communication skills.

Don't delay – download LinGo Play now and embark on your thrilling foreign language learning journey! Our app is available for iOS (compatible with iPad and iPhone), and we provide a wealth of free language-learning resources, including videos, podcasts, articles, and more, to support and enrich your learning experience. Join the vibrant and supportive LinGo community today, and start mastering foreign languages like a pro, while also reaping the numerous cognitive, social, and professional benefits of multilingualism!

For more information about our app and its features, visit www.lingo-play.com and review our terms of service at https://www.lingo-play.com/policy.php. If you have any questions or concerns, feel free to reach out to us at info@lingo-play.com. Our dedicated and passionate team of language learning experts is always eager to help you achieve your language learning objectives and unlock your full linguistic potential!

Helge app is for 13-19 y.o. students. Helge asks you questions about your wellbeing, analyzes the data, and provides real-time insight on how you are doing. If you wish to share your data with your school, then the data helps your teachers and school support specialists focus their solutions to the most pressing issues.

How does Helge work for you?
* Respond the regular test questions about well-being at school;
* Based on the test results the app gives you feedback and recommendations about your situation;
* If you wish, you can journal about your experiences, create tasks and explore new ideas;
* Only if you wish, you may share your results with your parents or with your school.

Helge app can be used individually. However, it works best for you when your school has joined Helge programme. Get in touch with us to start testing in your school. By making data-based decisions, educators can improve the school climate. They can create new school practices that are better suited to the contemporary needs of youngsters by becoming more aware of the dynamics in the classrooms and preventing wellbeing problems.

Youngsters are more actively engaged in designing their well-being at schools by being given the opportunity to making their voice heard. Together, we build an environment where young people who leave school are full of self-confidence and skills to deal with life's challenges and opportunities as sustainable people.

Our mission is to transform school system truly inclusive of young people and give every young person a voice for human sustainability.

Check our Privacy Policy: https://helge.app/privacy-policy/

Siuts on vahend lindude ja linnuhäälitsuste tundmaõppimiseks. Siutsu abil saad sa:
 * Salvestada helisid
    - määrata salvestisel kuuldavaid linde. Selleks pakub Siuts välja 5 kõige tõenäolisemat linnuliiki, tänu millele saad sa:
    - kuulata enda salvestatud heli ning võrrelda seda 5 väljapakutud linnu helidega;
    - lugeda lindude kohta lisainfot;
    - vaadata lindudest pilte;
    - kinnitada, et oled tuvastanud õige linnu;
    - välistada linnu, keda sinu hinnangul salvestisel kuulda polnud
 * Vaadata oma salvestiste ajalugu
 * Sirvida lindude kataloogis, mida Siuts toetab (hetkel 61 liiki)

Explore the modern medical center, and create your stories as a doctor, patient, or scientist! With unique gameplay, learn how to prevent infections with vaccines, masks, and hand disinfection in a fun and interactive way. 

FUTURE CLINIC AND CUTE BOTS 

This game takes you to a flu clinic of the future, where you'll meet 7 child-friendly robots serving as doctors and medical staff. This medical center is filled with the latest interactive technologies in every part of the building, ready for you to explore and create your stories. From a bacteria lab to a helicopter ambulance, from a lobby filled with mini games to a science lab. 

NEW HOSPITAL EXPERIENCES 

Like in the first edition of Pepi Hospital, this flu clinic of the future invites you to be creative and come up with your own stories. It’s also filled with a wide range of new activities. Become a doctor and treat patients with the latest interactive devices. Prevent infections with anti-virus vaccines. Play the role of a scientist and experiment with bacteria using cool science lab equipment. Or take on the role of a patient and receive care from adorable Pepi robots. 

INTERACTIVE GAMEPLAY 

The medical center is full of unique gameplay elements to make your future flu clinic stories even more enjoyable and unforgettable. Each room has a variety of interactive areas for you to explore, including smart screens that can help doctors to identify patients’ needs, science lab equipment to experiment with, and a mini-games screen in the lobby. 

KEEP THE EDUCATION FUN 

This game is perfect for families who want to play and learn together. Join the kids as they explore the medical center's exciting features, guide their exploration, and help them learn about the spread of diseases, the importance of vaccines, and simple ways to stay healthy. You can also help them make up stories with different characters, teach them about basic medical tools, and expand their vocabulary.

KEY FEATURES: 
• Unique gameplay that simulates virus infections; 
• Colorful and engaging graphics showcasing flu clinic of the future; 
• 30+ amazing characters: doctors, patients, robots, and visitors; 
• 7 friendly robot doctors to help treat patients; 
• A science lab with different bacteria to experiment with; 
• Mini-games screen with 3 enjoyable games; 
• Explore dozens of medical devices, items, and machines to experiment with; 
• A helicopter ambulance to transport patients to the hospital roof;
 • A great way to learn about hygiene and preventing the nasty flu!

